          "value": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> to <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gravesquires engage in a coordinated greatsword attack against each enemy within @Template[type:emanation|distance:10]{10 feet} (@Check[type:reflex|dc:23|basic:true] save). The damage depends on the number of actions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> @Damage[5d6[slashing]] damage</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> @Damage[(7d6)[slashing]] damage</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> @Damage[(9d6)[slashing]] damage</p>"
