          "value": "<p>The troop's members unleash a focused blast of cold energy. Each creature in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 30 feet of the troop takes @Damage[7d6[cold]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:22|basic:true] save).</p>\n<p>When the troop is reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this area decreases to a @Template[type:burst|distance:5].</p>"
