          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The troop has dealt cold damage to at least 1 creature this turn.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gravesquires charge, taking advantage of the opening they've made. The troop Strides in a straight line until they're adjacent to an enemy that they've dealt cold damage to this turn and then attack with Cleave Flesh (using the damage for the single-action version). </p>"
